# Model pipeline (MP-00)

Full text: `docs/spec-references/MP-00-INDEX-and-rules.md`. Family docs are not in the repo until the user feeds each file.

An MP is the only permission to change model-family wiring. Feed one MP per session. MP-01 through MP-12 are not started from this index. `spec-reconciliation-overlay.md` still wins on conflict. This queue does not replace build-0 through build-6 or BP-01 through BP-13, and it does not lift `GENERATION_PAUSED`.

## Order

MP-01 scaffolding (no family data). MP-02 Seedance with MP-02b composition and the tool matrix. Then Kling, Veo, Wan, MiniMax/Hailuo, Grok, PixVerse, HappyHorse, LTX, image models, tool connection, then MP-13 chained continuity. MP-14 Gemini Omni Flash 1.1 is wired. MP-15 ElevenLabs audio is wired on FAL. One family passes every mode before the next family starts.

## Every family inherits

1. Verify before wire. `GET https://fal.ai/api/openapi/queue/openapi.json?endpoint_id=<id>` first. 200 means the schema is ground truth. 404 means find the real id before any registry string is written. No endpoint string ships without that 200.
2. FamilyFieldMap, `buildPayload`, and `composePrompt` use the schema's fields, enums, and required set. The family doc is the map. If they disagree, stop and report. The schema wins.
3. Wire only the fed family. Payload includes only fields that schema lists. A missing field hides the control.
4. INV-1 through INV-8 from BP-00 still apply. Paid calls stay on `providerSubmit` / `submitToFal` / `claudeCall`.
5. The one real generation per mode in a family prompt is the user's. Do not run it while `GENERATION_PAUSED` is on.
6. HappyHorse stays benched until MP-09 is fed. Seedance 2.5, H3 Max, and Kling 2.6 are evaluate-only until a later fed prompt adopts them. Gemini Omni Flash 1.1 is wired (MP-14).
7. `shotMode` reference is the default for a recurring subject in a new composition. An anchor chain or a faithful keyframe uses first frame. No subject to condition on uses text. Seedance reference-to-video is the preferred reference route once MP-02b is fed.

On a paid-API task, run `node scripts/check-chokepoints.mjs` and report it. Do not touch files outside the fed prompt.
